T*
(function, while treatment exposure and adverse events were broadly comparable between) Tj
T*
(groups. Generalisability may be reduced because participating sites had established research) Tj
T*
(infrastructure. The analysis was designed to reflect the decisions faced by clinicians in) Tj
T*
